{"id":"592f91b518237a8b","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-ordinal-comparison.md","title":"序数比较","display":"df-ordinal-comparison — 序数比较","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-ordinal-comparison","aliases":["18-df-ordinal-comparison","18-df-014"],"display":"df-ordinal-comparison — 序数比较","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"3.2","source_printed_pages":"20","source_pdf_pages":"30","source_correspondence":"definition-correspondence","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-ordinal-comparison"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-ordinal-comparison</span><span>18-df-014</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ordinal-comparison — 序数比较"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"20"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"30"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"definition-correspondence"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> 为集合变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(&lt;_\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 为序数严格比较；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\le_\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 为其自反闭包。</li>\n<li>后续仅在序数参数上用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;,\\le\">\\(&lt;,\\le\\)</span> 代替 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_\\mathrm{Ord},\\le_\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(&lt;_\\mathrm{Ord},\\le_\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a&lt;_\\mathrm{Ord}b\\longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(b)\\land a\\in b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a&lt;_\\mathrm{Ord}b\\longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(b)\\land a\\in b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\le_\\mathrm{Ord}b\\longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(b)\\land(a=b\\lor a\\in b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\le_\\mathrm{Ord}b\\longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(b)\\land(a=b\\lor a\\in b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\n(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\longleftrightarrow\\alpha&lt;_\\mathrm{Ord}\\beta),\\qquad\n(\\alpha\\le\\beta\\longleftrightarrow\\alpha\\le_\\mathrm{Ord}\\beta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\n(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\longleftrightarrow\\alpha&lt;_\\mathrm{Ord}\\beta),\\qquad\n(\\alpha\\le\\beta\\longleftrightarrow\\alpha\\le_\\mathrm{Ord}\\beta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §3.2 的序数比较定义，显式保持序数类型限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a,b$ 为集合变量；$\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Ord}$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal]]。$<_\\mathrm{Ord}$ 为序数严格比较；$\\le_\\mathrm{Ord}$ 为其自反闭包。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"<_\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"<,\\le","display":false},{"tex":"<_\\mathrm{Ord},\\le_\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"a<_\\mathrm{Ord}b\\longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(b)\\land a\\in b.","display":true},{"tex":"a\\le_\\mathrm{Ord}b\\longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(b)\\land(a=b\\lor a\\in b).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\n(\\alpha<\\beta\\longleftrightarrow\\alpha<_\\mathrm{Ord}\\beta),\\qquad\n(\\alpha\\le\\beta\\longleftrightarrow\\alpha\\le_\\mathrm{Ord}\\beta).","display":true}],"bytes":1336,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-ordinal-comparison]]"},{"id":"83adc13498d19c2f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$ 是可定义的全类函数；类、类函数及其图均为元理论中的可定义类缩写，不作为 ZFC 中集合量词的取值。$\\mathrm{Ord}$、$<$、$\\mathrm{Lim}$ 分别见 [[18-df-ordinal]]、[[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]、[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]。"},{"id":"5ec4763cfc7da9d5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Lim}$；序数比较与后继见 [[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]、[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]。"},{"id":"b8684802726abc97","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ord},\\omega$ 取 [[18-df-ordinal]]，序数比较取 [[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]。"},{"id":"dbde69396a089d39","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，比较见 [[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]；序数类与 $0,\\omega$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal]]。"},{"id":"0add8a5835559b4b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}$ 是给定集合或可定义类，$e$ 是可定义部分类函数；$\\mathrm{Ord},<$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal]]、[[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]。类图的 $\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{ran}$ 是元语言缩写，真类不作为 ZFC 集合变量。$A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}$ 为集合，$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$；$\\mathrm{Iso}_\\in$ 明确表示集合序同构。$\\operatorname{otp}$ 是该唯一序数的可定义类函数，$\\mathrm{Enum}(X)$ 是下式的类图。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-ordinal-comparison]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-ordinal-comparison]]"}],"outgoing":["cf95026e035bcb2b"]}